The 52 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `5`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

namespace A341984

/-- Known terms of `A341984`, starting at index `5`. -/
def data : List retType :=
  [1, 5, 15, 30, 50, 71, 100, 130, 170, 195,
    231, 250, 310, 340, 420, 430, 525, 535, 685, 680,
    851, 800, 1025, 970, 1280, 1145, 1470, 1250, 1685, 1440,
